fragment_downloaded_cb({"url":"gstreamer/gstinfo.html#gst_log_context_builder_new","fragment":"\n\tgst_log_context_builder_new\n\nCreates a new builder for configuring a GstLogContext with the specified\ndebug category and flags.\nParameters:\nthe debug category to use\nthe flags to use for the log context\na new GstLogContextBuilder\n\n\tSince\t\t\t: 1.28\n\t\t\n"});